      "name": "ERPN3xp",
      "created_at": "2025-06-18T11:16:40.542Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, does anyone have any advice on how best to set up a Staging environment?</p>\n<p>I would like to provide a test version of ERPNext to allow end users to become familiar with the system, ideally we’d like it to be a copy of the production environment in terms of data and system configuration. Note: we are using Frappe cloud.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/a587f6/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 0,
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
