    {
      "id": 471773,
      "username": "Sudhanshu",
      "name": "Sudhanshu Badole",
      "created_at": "2025-06-18T11:29:17.884Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To set up a Staging environment in Frappe/ERPNext:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Create a new site</strong> on your server or another server.</li>\n<li><strong>Backup</strong> your production site using <code>bench backup</code> and restore it to the staging site using <code>bench restore</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Copy site config</strong> and <code>common_site_config.json</code> if needed.</li>\n<li><strong>Set a different DB and Redis port</strong> if hosting on same server.</li>\n<li>Disable email or set dummy SMTP to prevent accidental emails.</li>\n<li>Update site name and branding if required.</li>\n<li>Use <code>bench start</code> or set up as production with <code>bench setup production</code>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Now you have a near-identical test system.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/sudhanshu/{size}/68856_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
      "like_action": null,
      "Reads": 54,
      "wikis": null,
